Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: testchar.c
Line: 812
Function: testUTF8Chunks
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: xmlCreatePushParserCtxt return value (ctxt) is not checked; subsequent calls like xmlParseChunk(ctxt, ...) will dereference a NULL parser context on allocation failure.

Source context:
```c
